  {
   "id": "gennady-252013@major-2026-08-26",
   "gameId": "gennady-252013",
   "displayName": "The Final Final Demo Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-08-26T02:19:07.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Alright, guys, let’s do this one last time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The game’s release is just around the corner, so we’re updating the demo once again.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Global Balance Adjustments",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’ve made the first biome more beginner-friendly, adjusted trap damage and enemy counts, and slightly lowered the barrier to entry. That doesn’t mean the Meat Factory has turned into a walk in the park — there are still plenty of challenging sections, they just appear much later now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44152322/cb7b330b8eeeda68d35874be57bcfb06fe353cfe.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ah... If only you had seen the early versions of the game, where the green goo, presses, and lasers killed the player instantly. Those were the days.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Updated Alley of the Dead System",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Out with the ammo, in with the container!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ammo has been completely removed from the game. It has been replaced by a container that the player always starts with by default. It can store a certain number of artifacts and larvae and carry them over into the next run.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can also buy a larger container in Sho’s shop. However, this container has its own durability, which decreases every time you visit the Alley of the Dead.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44152322/d64e124e2defd66584d0b0db62db1dd3d92cbd0f.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New Localization",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’ve added full Chinese localization thanks to our partner, Vsoo Games. We’ve also added Japanese.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Before release, we plan to add all of the remaining languages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bug Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where the loading screen would disappear if you died during the tutorial. You seriously died in the tutorial?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where the Worker could deal instant damage without playing an animation after recovering from a stun.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where the Inspector could deal contact damage while attacking.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed several localization issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed issues with some artifacts.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We plan to officially announce the release date soon, so don’t miss the announcement!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "digest": {
    "new": 2,
