  {
   "id": "gennady-252013@major-2026-04-30",
   "gameId": "gennady-252013",
   "displayName": "The final demo update is here!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-04-30T03:48:27.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "01010111 01101000 01111001 00100000 01100100 01101001 01100100 00100000 01111001 01101111 01110101 00100000 01110100 01110010 01100001 01101110 01110011 01101100 01100001 01110100 01100101 00100000 01110100 01101000 01101001 01110011 00111111",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Or, as they say in three-dimensional space — greetings!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The final demo update is here. As far as major updates go, this will be the last one. So let’s go through what exactly we’ve added:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "— Artifacts & Upgrades",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A lot of new artifacts of varying usefulness — but all of them are cool. Some are tied to new systems like luck and companions. Some are available right away, others must be found in chests. Building a specific setup is now much more straightforward… and breaking the game is far more likely.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44152322/4061cf28ab2a2e1ec0c378a3c248a6528e531293.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "— Story",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Pages scattered across the alien factory are waiting to be found. Let’s be honest: reading the first four parts will probably not answer your questions — if anything, you’ll have even more. But, to be fair, you might start to get a sense of what’s going on. Maybe. [img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44152322/e09c4c5b378c1ab6a4269e9d548b8b4549f6a234.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "— Challenge Rooms",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For those seeking a true challenge and a worthy reward, the challenge room opens its doors. There’s only one rule — survive. [img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44152322/6730515e1fec1d3673a32d6532085d6befdd88b6.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "— Collections",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new tab in the game menu where you can find almost all the useful information: you can view artifacts (which ones you’ve unlocked and which are yet to be found), read discovered story entries — for those who like to dig deep into the lore, and learn more about enemies. Can such a rich fauna really be ignored?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44152322/5bb0d3e7fe741228f5187fff007d72d511752a98.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "— Tutorial Update",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tweaked a bit here, adjusted a bit there. Now don’t say we never told you anything! Though honestly, if your kind paid more attention to text, the learning process would go much faster.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "— New Voice-over",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve completely reworked the English voice-over. Now it’s easier to understand what that guy in his underwear is mumbling about. There’s also now a separate volume setting for voice.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "These are all the major additions in this version. On top of that, we’ve made plenty of smaller tweaks — though only the most observant will notice them. Future updates will mostly focus on bug fixes, with maybe a few minor improvements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In any case, the next stop is the full release. Final stop!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Or, as we say in our two-dimensional world: …",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "01001110 01101111 00101100 00100000 01110011 01100101 01110010 01101001 01101111 01110101 01110011 01101100 01111001 00100000 11100010 10000000 10010100 00100000 01100111 01101111 00100000 01110100 01101111 01110101 01100011 01101000 00100000 01110011 01101111 01101101 01100101 00100000 01100111 01110010 01100001 01110011 01110011",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
